-- The live ^cursor is one frozen deictic for all three effects in the first statement. The final bare cursor reaches the independent registry binding, proving the overlay did not rewrite it.
--! registry ../registries/019-sequenced-effects.reg
--! expect pos = 0 10 25 30 40 50
--! expect tint = None None Red None None None
--! expect shielded = 1 1 0 0 1 0
--! expect gold = 1005 10 15 1020 25 30
--! expect blessed = 1 1 0 1 0 1

^cursor , Knockback 5 ; Flash :Red ; -Shielded
Nord & TwoHanded > 60 , Gold += 1000 ; +Blessed
cursor , Blessed = 1
